'''Spectral Goth Vega''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror (Gacha Event)|Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror]] and [[Colossus Busters (Gacha Event)|Colossus Busters]] events. She was added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]] increases health and damage and grants [[Zombie Killer]].

