==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Illusory Guardian Vega''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Lady of Deception Vega''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Spectral Goth Vega is a mid-ranged Long Distance debuffer who has a chance to weaken traited enemies. Like all Girls & Monsters units, she has multi-hit, but she has only two consecutive attacks instead of a usual three. Along with [[Strong Against]] traited, only Spectral Goth Vega also has [[Colossus Slayer]] and [[Immune to Toxic|Toxic immunity]].

Offensively, Spectral Goth Vega has below-average DPS. At level 30, she has only a measly 3k DPS against [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]], 4.5k~5.4k DPS against traited, and 8.6k DPS against [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossi]]. However, this DPS only applies to enemies who stand between 230~381 range or those who get knocked back into her second multi-attack range, although the latter is rather a rare occurence. For enemies not included in the above conditions, she has only half her achievable DPS. Unfortunately, the only Colossus enemies that actually sit in the 230~381 range are [[Great Angel Chibinel]], [[Mega-Mooth]] and [[Baron Seal]].

Defensively, Spectral Goth Vega sports 68k health vs Traitless, 136k-170k health vs traited, and almost 200k health vs. Colossus enemies. Combined with her [[Weaken]], Spectral Goth Vega can last a very long time on the field, even against merciless high-level Colossi. Her Toxic immunity also gives her an edge against enemies like [[Gobble]], [[Zollow]], [[Oldstrich]] and especially [[Big Peng Z]]. Spectral Goth Vega has no curse immunity, meaning using her against most [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relics]] is discouraged.

Against Colossus enemies, her Slayer ability doesn't help much since her base damage is so low, but since Colossus enemies tend to have massive HP pools, her Multi-Hit doesn't really matter, in fact helping with more weaken chances to increase your other units' survivability and hitting backliners with her 250 piercing range.

Overall, Spectral Goth Vega is a hardy unit that can help stunt traited progress and works well with other debuffer units to produce a robust defense.

==='''True Form'''===
Lady of Deception Vega addresses one of Illusory Guardian Vega's most prevalent issues: her mediocre DPS. Now, her damage is nearly on par with even [[Goddess of Light Sirius (Uber Rare Cat)|Goddess of Sunrise Sirius]]! She has also recieved the [[Zombie Killer]] ability, which improves her quality of life. Despite her health already being good, it gains a 30% increase, bringing her effective HP with Weaken to 442,000 VS enemies affected by [[Fruit Treasures]], and 353,000 vs. Relic/[[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] at level 30.

While these improvements may seem inconsequential, they are well worth it for such a low cost.

