==Trivia==
*Spectral Goth Vega is a counterpart to [[Goddess of Light Sirius (Uber Rare Cat)|Goddess of Light Sirius]]. Both come from the [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]] game [[GirlsMons]], both are named after some of the brightest stars in the night sky ([[wikipedia:Vega|Vega]] is the fifth brightest star, while [[wikipedia:Sirius|Sirius]] is the brightest overall), both have Colossus Slayer and are strong against traited enemies, and Illusory Guardian Vega's Japanese description calls her a goddess of darkness, and Sirius's description calls her a goddess of light.

